\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Where kit exposure actually accrues: share of quality-weighted exposure per kit slot}, aggregated over eight full-highlight analyses (\S  \ref {sec:exp-counterfactual}; the ninth match is excluded after the attribution audit described there, since its kept detections are not trustworthy). Percentages are weighted by each match's attributed exposure and cover only detections the pose stage could assign to a slot. The distribution is strongly non-uniform — the two shoulder slots alone carry $\sim $30\% of attributed exposure, an order of magnitude more than a sock slot — which is exactly the structure a single flat placement multiplier cannot express.}}{7}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:kitslots}{{4}{7}{\textbf {Where kit exposure actually accrues: share of quality-weighted exposure per kit slot}, aggregated over eight full-highlight analyses (\S \ref {sec:exp-counterfactual}; the ninth match is excluded after the attribution audit described there, since its kept detections are not trustworthy). Percentages are weighted by each match's attributed exposure and cover only detections the pose stage could assign to a slot. The distribution is strongly non-uniform — the two shoulder slots alone carry $\sim $30\% of attributed exposure, an order of magnitude more than a sock slot — which is exactly the structure a single flat placement multiplier cannot express}{figure.4}{}}
